Falsifies `rsext4::crc32c::crc32c::verification::software_crc32c_tables_equal_bitwise_definition`.

The defect: the eight-byte round reads the first table at the wrong index for the word's top
byte, so a round whose last byte is set mixes in the wrong entry.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!`, the round against the bitwise definition.

